commit 47cb67de
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 12:07:11 -0600
subject: feat(observability): add error categorization engine

- New open-sse/utils/errorCategorizer.js: pure categorizeError(status, text)
  mapping failures to stable categories: rate_limit, auth, billing, timeout,
  overloaded, content_filter, invalid_request, network, unknown. Status-code
  rules are decisive; text patterns catch generic-status cases; 5xx/4xx
  range fallbacks; null-safe.
- chatCore error paths (executor throw + provider non-ok) and the streaming
  non-SSE path attach errorCategory to the captured requestDetail.
- Markdown report shows category per failed request.

Tests: tests/unit/error-categorizer.test.js — 4 tests (status rules, text
rules, fallbacks, case-insensitivity/null-safety). All pass.

Part of: Observability & Conversation Analytics plan (Phase P3)


